  {
    id: "webhooks", en: "Webhook inboxes", zh: "Webhook 收件箱",
    eps: [
      { m: "GET", p: "/hooks/inboxes", en: "The project's latest 50 inboxes. Receiver URLs are never listed again.", zh: "当前项目最新的 50 个收件箱。接收地址不会再次返回。", res: `{ inboxes: [{ id, name, created_at }] }` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/hooks/inboxes", en: "Create an inbox (owner or admin; at most 10 per project). The secret receiver path is returned only in this response; only its hash is stored. Returns 201, or 409 at the limit.", zh: "创建收件箱（需所有者或管理员；每个项目最多 10 个）。秘密接收路径仅在此响应中返回，服务端只保存其哈希。返回 201，达到上限返回 409。", req: `name  string, 1-100`, res: `{ id, name, path: "/api/hooks/receive/<id>/<token>", warning }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id/events", en: "Captured events, newest first, 50 per page (owner or admin). Each inbox keeps up to 250 events for 7 days. Pass the returned next as before for the following page; 410 means that event was evicted, so start again. method filters by POST, PUT or PATCH; q matches text in headers, content type or body (wildcards are literal). Unknown parameters return 400.", zh: "已捕获的事件，按时间倒序，每页 50 条（需所有者或管理员）。每个收件箱保留最多 250 条、7 天。将返回的 next 作为 before 传入以获取下一页；返回 410 表示该事件已被清理，请从头开始。method 按 POST、PUT 或 PATCH 过滤；q 匹配请求头、内容类型或正文中的文本（通配符按字面处理）。未知参数返回 400。", req: `before  uuid (optional)   the next value of the previous page
method  "POST" | "PUT" | "PATCH" (optional)
q       string, max 200 (optional)`, res: `{ events: [{ id, method, content_type, headers, body, created_at, response_status }], next: uuid | null }
response_status  the status the receiver answered (null for events captured before configurable responses)` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id/events/:eventId", en: "Delete one captured event (owner or admin). Returns 204, or 404 if it is not in this inbox.", zh: "删除一条已捕获的事件（需所有者或管理员）。返回 204；不属于该收件箱时返回 404。" },
      { m: "POST", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id/events/:eventId/replay", en: "Resend a captured event to a development endpoint (owner or admin, signed in or with an API key; 20 per minute per inbox, 60 per workspace and 60 per user). The method, body, content type and stored headers are sent, plus x-montral-replay with the event id. Only public addresses are reachable (400 target_not_allowed otherwise), even when ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS is set; a self-hosted operator can allow private development endpoints with MONTRAL_REPLAY_PRIVATE_TARGETS, but link-local and cloud metadata addresses are always refused. Redirects are not followed; the call waits at most 10 seconds (504) and returns the first 4 KiB of the response. Nothing about the replay is stored. Authorized agents (OAuth/MCP) get 403.", zh: "将已捕获的事件重新发送到开发端点（需所有者或管理员，登录会话或 API 密钥；每个收件箱每分钟 20 次，每个工作区和每个用户各 60 次）。发送原请求的方法、正文、内容类型和已保存的请求头，并附带含事件 id 的 x-montral-replay。只能访问公网地址（否则返回 400 target_not_allowed），即使设置了 ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS 也是如此；自托管运维可通过 MONTRAL_REPLAY_PRIVATE_TARGETS 允许私有开发端点，但链路本地和云元数据地址始终被拒绝。不跟随重定向；最多等待 10 秒（504），返回响应的前 4 KiB。重放不会保存任何记录。已授权的智能体（OAuth/MCP）返回 403。", req: `url  http(s) URL, max 2048`, res: `{ status, contentType, body, truncated, durationMs }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id/response", en: "What the receiver answers to captured requests (owner or admin). null means the default 202 {\"received\":true}.", zh: "接收端对已捕获请求的响应配置（需所有者或管理员）。null 表示默认的 202 {\"received\":true}。", res: `{ response: { status, contentType, body, headers: [{ name, value }], location?, delayMs, methods? } | null }` },
      { m: "PUT", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id/response", en: "Set the receiver's response, replacing any previous one (owner or admin; API keys and agents need write access). Returns 200 with the stored configuration, 400 with the reason when it is refused, or 413 above 512 KiB. Only captured requests get it: 404, 408, 413, 422 and 429 refusals keep their fixed answers, and replay never uses it. The privacy headers (cache-control: private, no-store; referrer-policy: no-referrer; x-content-type-options: nosniff; x-robots-tag: noindex, nofollow) and content-security-policy: default-src 'none'; sandbox are always sent and cannot be replaced. XML and CSV bodies are always sent with content-disposition: attachment, so a browser downloads them instead of rendering them (XML could otherwise display XHTML or SVG on this origin); text/plain and application/json are shown as plain text. Custom header names come from an allow-list: x-* names, except reserved families (x-accel-*, x-forwarded-*, x-montral-*, x-envoy-*, x-varnish*, x-litespeed-*, x-sendfile, x-frame-*, x-xss-*, x-real-* and similar), plus retry-after, content-language, warning, deprecation, sunset, allow, accept-patch, accept-post, request-id, correlation-id, idempotency-key, traceparent, tracestate and ratelimit, ratelimit-policy, ratelimit-limit, ratelimit-remaining, ratelimit-reset. Everything else is refused, including cookies, CORS, caching, security policies, client hints and framing headers. The delay is waited only after the request was captured, and only while a slot is free: 5 per inbox, 20 per organization and 200 in total per server process (per isolate on Cloudflare Workers). Without a free slot the configured response is sent at once; the delay never causes a refusal. A 3xx location is a redirect on this instance's address for anyone who holds the secret receiver URL, and only POST, PUT and PATCH reach the receiver; treat it like any open redirect you configure. Recorded in the audit log as hook_inbox.response_update with field names and the status only.", zh: "设置接收端响应，替换之前的配置（需所有者或管理员；API 密钥和智能体需要写权限）。返回 200 和保存后的配置；被拒绝时返回 400 并说明原因；超过 512 KiB 返回 413。只有被捕获的请求会收到此响应：404、408、413、422 和 429 拒绝保持固定响应，重放也从不使用它。隐私响应头（cache-control: private, no-store；referrer-policy: no-referrer；x-content-type-options: nosniff；x-robots-tag: noindex, nofollow）和 content-security-policy: default-src 'none'; sandbox 始终发送且不能被替换。XML 和 CSV 正文始终带 content-disposition: attachment 发送，浏览器会下载而不是渲染（否则 XML 可能在本站点上显示 XHTML 或 SVG）；text/plain 和 application/json 按纯文本显示。自定义响应头名称来自允许列表：x-* 名称（保留前缀除外，如 x-accel-*、x-forwarded-*、x-montral-*、x-envoy-*、x-varnish*、x-litespeed-*、x-sendfile、x-frame-*、x-xss-*、x-real-* 等），以及 retry-after、content-language、warning、deprecation、sunset、allow、accept-patch、accept-post、request-id、correlation-id、idempotency-key、traceparent、tracestate 和 ratelimit、ratelimit-policy、ratelimit-limit、ratelimit-remaining、ratelimit-reset。其他响应头一律拒绝，包括 Cookie、CORS、缓存、安全策略、客户端提示和分帧相关的响应头。延迟只在请求被捕获之后、且有空闲槽位时才会等待：每个收件箱 5 个、每个组织 20 个、每个服务器进程共 200 个（在 Cloudflare Workers 上按 isolate 计）。没有空闲槽位时立即发送配置的响应；延迟永远不会导致请求被拒绝。3xx 的 location 是本实例地址上的重定向，任何持有秘密接收地址的人都能触发，且只有 POST、PUT 和 PATCH 能到达接收端；请像对待你自己配置的开放重定向一样谨慎使用。审计日志记录为 hook_inbox.response_update，只包含字段名和状态码。", req: `status       integer 200-599 (default 200)
contentType  "text/plain" | "application/json" | "application/xml" | "text/xml" | "text/csv"
             (default "text/plain"; sent with charset=utf-8; XML and CSV sent as attachments; HTML and SVG are not supported)
body         string (default ""); all bodies of the inbox together at most 64 KiB UTF-8, no NUL;
             must be empty for 204, 205 and 304
headers      [{ name, value }], at most 20 (8 KiB total); name from the allow-list above, up to 64 characters,
             value printable ASCII up to 1024 characters without line breaks or surrounding spaces
location     absolute http(s) URL without credentials, max 2048, only with a 3xx status (optional)
delayMs      integer 0-10000 (default 0)
methods      { POST?, PUT?, PATCH? }: per-method { status, contentType, body, headers, location } (optional)`, res: `{ response: { status, contentType, body, headers, location?, delayMs, methods? } }` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id/response", en: "Back to the default 202 {\"received\":true} (owner or admin). Captured events are kept. Returns 204; recorded as hook_inbox.response_update.", zh: "恢复默认的 202 {\"received\":true}（需所有者或管理员）。已捕获的事件会保留。返回 204；审计日志记录为 hook_inbox.response_update。" },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/hooks/inboxes/:id", en: "Delete an inbox and all its events (owner or admin). Returns 204.", zh: "删除收件箱及其全部事件（需所有者或管理员）。返回 204。" },
    ],
    noteEn: "Senders POST, PUT or PATCH to the secret receiver path without other credentials. Bodies are capped at 32 KiB and must be valid UTF-8 text (413 / 422); each inbox accepts 120 events per minute (429). Only an allowlist of headers is stored (content-type, user-agent, x-request-id, x-event-type, x-github-event, x-shopify-topic; 300 characters each), so credentials such as Authorization or Cookie are never kept. Accepted events return 202 {\"received\":true}, or the inbox's configured response (see PUT /hooks/inboxes/:id/response).",
    noteZh: "发送方无需其他凭据，向秘密接收路径发送 POST、PUT 或 PATCH 请求。正文上限 32 KiB，且必须是有效的 UTF-8 文本（413 / 422）；每个收件箱每分钟接收 120 个事件（429）。仅保存白名单中的请求头（content-type、user-agent、x-request-id、x-event-type、x-github-event、x-shopify-topic，每个最多 300 字符），因此 Authorization、Cookie 等凭据不会被保存。接收成功返回 202 {\"received\":true}，或收件箱配置的响应（见 PUT /hooks/inboxes/:id/response）。",
  },
  {
    id: "oncall", en: "On-call and escalation", zh: "值班与升级",
    noteEn: "Permissions: workspace owners and admins create, change and delete schedules, layers, escalation policies and anyone's overrides. Every member can read them, see who is on call and list shifts, and may add an override for themselves only (taking a shift, a swap) and remove an override they created for themselves; each person manages their own calendar feed. A key limited to specific projects reads its projects' and workspace-wide schedules and policies and changes only its projects' ones. Ids from another workspace are not found (404). Concurrency: every schedule and policy carries a version; a change must send the version it read and a stale one gets 409 { code: \"version_conflict\", currentVersion }, so concurrent edits never overwrite each other. Layer changes bump the schedule's version. Engine: handoffs happen at the local wall-clock time of the schedule's IANA zone; a handoff time skipped by a spring-forward change happens at the next valid instant (when the clocks jump) and a time repeated by a fall-back change happens once, at its first occurrence. A later layer covers earlier ones wherever it has someone on call (restriction windows leave gaps that earlier layers fill); overrides beat every layer, and where overrides overlap the latest created wins. A person who left the workspace is skipped: their rotation shift goes to the next member in the layer's order and their overrides are ignored. Escalation: a monitor with an escalation policy pages step 1 as soon as an incident opens (on the scheduler's next tick), then the next step whenever nobody acknowledges within the step's timeoutMin; after the last step it starts over repeatCount more times, then stops. Each step is claimed by exactly one server. People (named or on call) get an email at their account address and a push on the phones they registered, through the regular delivery rows, so failed attempts are retried like any alert. Acknowledging stops escalation (re-checked right before each page is queued and again before it is sent) and assigns the incident to the acknowledger only when nobody owns it yet; before this change acknowledging always reassigned it. Resolving stops everything. A policy's first step skips channels that already got the incident's down alert. Every step is written to the incident's timeline as an internal update and to the audit log (incident.escalate, and incident.escalation_notify per person).",
    noteZh: "权限：工作区所有者和管理员可以创建、修改和删除值班表、层级、升级策略以及任何人的替班。所有成员都可以查看这些内容、查看当前值班人和班次，并且只能为自己添加替班（顶班、换班），也只能删除自己为自己创建的替班；每个人自行管理自己的日历订阅。限定特定项目的密钥可以读取其项目及工作区级的值班表和策略，但只能修改其项目的。其他工作区的 id 一律返回 404。并发：每个值班表和策略都有 version；修改时必须带上读取到的 version，过期的版本返回 409 { code: \"version_conflict\", currentVersion }，因此并发编辑不会互相覆盖。修改层级也会增加值班表的 version。计算规则：交接按值班表 IANA 时区的当地墙钟时间进行；因夏令时开始而不存在的交接时间，在下一个有效时刻（时钟跳变时）交接；因夏令时结束而重复出现的时间只交接一次，即第一次出现时。在后面的层级有人值班的时段，它覆盖前面的层级（限制时段留下的空档由前面的层级补上）；替班优先于所有层级，替班重叠时以最新创建的为准。已离开工作区的人会被跳过：其轮值班次交给层级顺序中的下一位成员，其替班不再生效。升级：设置了升级策略的监控在事件开启后（调度器下一次运行时）立即通知第 1 步，之后只要在该步骤的 timeoutMin 内无人确认就通知下一步；最后一步之后再从头重复 repeatCount 次，然后停止。每一步只会被一台服务器领取。被通知的人（指定的人或值班人）会收到发往其账号邮箱的邮件，以及发往其注册手机的推送；这些都走常规投递记录，失败会像其他告警一样重试。确认事件即停止升级（在每次通知入队前以及发送前都会再次检查），并且只有当事件尚无负责人时才指派给确认者；在此之前，确认总会重新指派。解决事件则全部停止。策略的第一步会跳过已收到该事件故障告警的渠道。每一步都会作为内部更新写入事件时间线，并写入审计日志（incident.escalate，以及每个被通知者一条 incident.escalation_notify）。",
    eps: [
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/now", en: "Who is on call right now on every schedule, with the current shift's start and end (within 14 days) and its source.", zh: "所有值班表当前的值班人，包含当前班次的开始和结束时间（14 天以内）及其来源。", res: `{ at, schedules: [{ scheduleId, scheduleName, projectId, timeZone, onCall: { userId, name, start, end, source: "layer" | "override", layerId, overrideId } | null }] }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/members", en: "The workspace's members, to put in rotations, steps and overrides. A signed-in session gets name, email and role; an API key or an agent only ids and names.", zh: "工作区成员，可用于轮值、升级步骤和替班。登录会话可获得姓名、邮箱和角色；API 密钥或智能体只能获得 id 和姓名。", res: `[{ userId, name, email, role }]   (keys and agents: [{ userId, name }])` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/schedules", en: "Schedules with their layers and who is on call now.", zh: "值班表及其层级和当前值班人。", res: `[{ id, projectId, name, timeZone, version, layers: [{ id, position, name, userIds, rotationType, shiftLengthHours, handoffTime, handoffWeekday, startDate, restrictions }], onCallNow, createdAt, updatedAt }]` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/oncall/schedules", en: "Create a schedule (owner or admin). Every person in a rotation must be a member. Returns 201 with version 1.", zh: "创建值班表（需所有者或管理员）。轮值中的每个人都必须是成员。返回 201，version 为 1。", req: `name       string, 1-80
timeZone   IANA zone, e.g. "Europe/London"
projectId  uuid | null (default null = workspace-wide; required for project-limited keys)
layers     up to 10, lowest precedence first:
  name              string, 1-80 (default "Layer")
  userIds           user ids in rotation order, 1-50
  rotationType      "daily" | "weekly" | "custom"
  shiftLengthHours  custom only: integer 1-2016; under 24 hours measured in elapsed time from the first handoff (every slot keeps its full length across DST changes), 24 hours or more on the local wall clock
  handoffTime       "HH:MM" local (default "09:00")
  handoffWeekday    weekly only: 0 (Sunday) - 6 (Saturday); null = the weekday of startDate
  startDate         "YYYY-MM-DD" local: the first shift starts then
  restrictions      up to 7 windows [{ days: [1,2,3,4,5], start: "09:00", end: "17:00" }]; end at or before start crosses midnight` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id", en: "One schedule with its layers and who is on call now.", zh: "单个值班表及其层级和当前值班人。" },
      { m: "PATCH", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id", en: "Change the name, time zone or layers (owner or admin). layers replaces the list: a layer with the id of an existing one keeps that id. 409 version_conflict on a stale version.", zh: "修改名称、时区或层级（需所有者或管理员）。layers 会替换整个列表：带有已有层级 id 的层级保留该 id。版本过期时返回 409 version_conflict。", req: `version   integer, the version you read (required)
name, timeZone, layers  as for POST (each optional)` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id?version=", en: "Delete a schedule (owner or admin). 409 schedule_in_use while an escalation policy or a project's levels name it; 409 version_conflict when version is given and stale. Returns 204.", zh: "删除值班表（需所有者或管理员）。仍被升级策略或项目升级级别引用时返回 409 schedule_in_use；提供了 version 且已过期时返回 409 version_conflict。返回 204。" },
      { m: "POST", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/layers", en: "Add a layer at the top (owner or admin). Returns 201 with the schedule.", zh: "在最上层添加一个层级（需所有者或管理员）。返回 201 和值班表。", req: `version  integer (required)
layer    a layer as for POST /oncall/schedules` },
      { m: "PATCH", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/layers/:layerId", en: "Change some fields of one layer (owner or admin). Returns the schedule.", zh: "修改单个层级的部分字段（需所有者或管理员）。返回值班表。", req: `version  integer (required)
any layer field (optional)` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/layers/:layerId?version=", en: "Remove a layer (owner or admin; version required). Returns the schedule.", zh: "删除层级（需所有者或管理员；必须提供 version）。返回值班表。" },
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/shifts?from=&to=", en: "Who is on call from when to when, overrides included, with gaps where nobody is. from and to are ISO 8601 date-times; defaults: now and 14 days later; the range may span at most 90 days (400 beyond).", zh: "从何时到何时由谁值班，包含替班，无人值班处留空。from 和 to 为 ISO 8601 时间；默认从现在起 14 天；范围最长 90 天（超出返回 400）。", res: `{ scheduleId, timeZone, from, to, shifts: [{ userId, name, start, end, source, layerId, overrideId }] }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/overrides?from=&to=", en: "Overrides overlapping the range (same defaults and limit as shifts).", zh: "与该范围重叠的替班（默认值和上限同 shifts）。", res: `[{ id, scheduleId, userId, startsAt, endsAt, createdBy, createdAt }]` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/overrides", en: "Put someone on call for a while (owner or admin for anyone; a member for themselves only, 403 otherwise). At most 90 days long, starting at most a year ahead, ending in the future; the person must be a member. A schedule holds at most 500 overrides that have not ended and a person at most 50 on one schedule (409 override_limit); each person may create 60 per hour (429). Returns 201.", zh: "让某人在一段时间内值班（所有者或管理员可为任何人添加；成员只能为自己添加，否则 403）。最长 90 天，最多提前一年开始，结束时间必须在将来；该人必须是成员。每个值班表最多保留 500 个未结束的替班，每人在同一值班表上最多 50 个（409 override_limit）；每人每小时最多创建 60 个（429）。返回 201。", req: `userId    user id
startsAt  ISO 8601 date-time
endsAt    ISO 8601 date-time, after startsAt` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/oncall/schedules/:id/overrides/:overrideId", en: "Remove an override (owner or admin; a member only an override they created for themselves). Returns 204.", zh: "删除替班（所有者或管理员；成员只能删除自己为自己创建的替班）。返回 204。" },
      { m: "GET", p: "/oncall/calendar", en: "Whether the caller has an active calendar feed link.", zh: "调用者是否有有效的日历订阅链接。", res: `{ active, createdAt, lastUsedAt }` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/oncall/calendar?replace=", en: "Create the caller's iCalendar feed link (signed-in sessions only; API keys and agents get 403). With a link already active the call is refused (409 calendar_link_active) unless replace=true, which revokes the old link at once (replaced: true in the response). The link is returned only in this response; only a hash of its token is stored. The feed lists only the caller's own shifts, on every schedule of the workspace (members can read all of the workspace's projects), from 7 days ago to 60 days ahead, and stops working when the link is replaced or revoked, or the person leaves the workspace. Returns 201.", zh: "创建调用者的 iCalendar 订阅链接（仅限登录会话；API 密钥和智能体返回 403）。已有有效链接时会被拒绝（409 calendar_link_active），除非传入 replace=true，此时旧链接立即失效（响应中 replaced 为 true）。链接仅在此响应中返回，服务端只保存其令牌的哈希。订阅只包含调用者本人的班次，覆盖工作区的所有值班表（成员可以查看工作区的所有项目），时间范围为 7 天前到未来 60 天；链接被替换或撤销、或该人离开工作区后即失效。返回 201。", res: `{ url: "https://…/api/public/oncall/<token>.ics", createdAt, replaced, warning }` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/oncall/calendar", en: "Revoke the caller's feed link. Returns 204.", zh: "撤销调用者的订阅链接。返回 204。" },
      { m: "GET", p: "/escalation-policies", en: "Escalation policies.", zh: "升级策略列表。", res: `[{ id, projectId, name, steps: [{ timeoutMin, channelIds, userIds, scheduleIds }], repeatCount, version, createdAt, updatedAt }]` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/escalation-policies", en: "Create a policy (owner or admin). Each step needs at least one channel, person or schedule; channels and schedules must be workspace-wide or of the policy's project; people must be members. Returns 201.", zh: "创建策略（需所有者或管理员）。每一步至少需要一个渠道、人员或值班表；渠道和值班表必须是工作区级或属于策略所在项目；人员必须是成员。返回 201。", req: `name         string, 1-80
projectId    uuid | null (default null)
repeatCount  integer 0-5 (default 0): how many more times the steps run after the last one
steps        1-10 of { timeoutMin: 1-1440, channelIds: uuid[] max 10, userIds: string[] max 20, scheduleIds: uuid[] max 5 }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/escalation-policies/:id", en: "One policy and the monitors that use it.", zh: "单个策略及使用它的监控。", res: `{ ...policy, monitors: [{ id, name }] }` },
      { m: "PATCH", p: "/escalation-policies/:id", en: "Change the name, steps or repeat count (owner or admin). 409 version_conflict on a stale version. Incidents already escalating continue at their current level with the new steps.", zh: "修改名称、步骤或重复次数（需所有者或管理员）。版本过期时返回 409 version_conflict。正在升级的事件以当前级别继续使用新步骤。", req: `version  integer (required)
name, steps, repeatCount  (each optional)` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/escalation-policies/:id?version=", en: "Delete a policy (owner or admin). Monitors that used it go back to their project's escalation levels for new incidents; their open incidents stop escalating (an internal timeline update says so). Returns 204.", zh: "删除策略（需所有者或管理员）。使用它的监控对新事件改用其项目的升级级别；其未结束的事件停止升级（事件时间线会有一条内部更新说明）。返回 204。" },
      { m: "PUT", p: "/projects/:id/alerting", en: "The project's repeats and escalation levels (owner or admin), used by monitors without a policy. A level notifies its channels, people and whoever is on call on its schedules when the incident is still unacknowledged escalateAfterMin minutes after it started. Levels with channelIds only (the original shape) stay valid.", zh: "项目的重复提醒和升级级别（需所有者或管理员），用于未设置策略的监控。事件开始 escalateAfterMin 分钟后仍未确认时，该级别会通知其渠道、人员以及其值班表上的值班人。只有 channelIds 的级别（原有格式）依然有效。", req: `reminderIntervalMin  null | 5 | 10 | 15 | 30 | 60
reminderEmail        boolean
escalation           up to 3 of { escalateAfterMin: 1-1440 (each later than the one before), channelIds: uuid[] max 5, userIds?: string[] max 10, scheduleIds?: uuid[] max 3 }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/public/oncall/:token.ics", en: "The calendar feed itself (no other credentials; 120 requests per hour per address). text/calendar with one event per shift in UTC, sent with cache-control: private, no-store; 404 for an unknown, replaced or revoked token.", zh: "日历订阅本身（无需其他凭据；每个地址每小时 120 次）。返回 text/calendar，每个班次一个事件（UTC 时间）；未知、已替换或已撤销的令牌返回 404。" },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: "audit", en: "Audit log", zh: "审计日志",
    eps: [
      { m: "GET", p: "/audit-events", en: "The workspace audit log, newest first (owner or admin; members get 403, and so do API keys or agents limited to specific projects, because the log covers the whole workspace). Query: limit (1-200, default 50), cursor (the next value of the previous page), action (a prefix: monitor, status_page.domain, member.role_change), actorId, targetType, targetId, from and to (ISO 8601 with offset; from inclusive, to exclusive). Pages are ordered by (createdAt, id), so they never skip or repeat events. Unknown parameters and a malformed cursor return 400.", zh: "工作区审计日志，按时间倒序（需所有者或管理员；普通成员返回 403，仅限部分项目的 API 密钥或智能体同样返回 403，因为日志覆盖整个工作区）。查询参数：limit（1-200，默认 50）、cursor（上一页返回的 next）、action（前缀，如 monitor、status_page.domain、member.role_change）、actorId、targetType、targetId、from 和 to（带时区偏移的 ISO 8601；from 含、to 不含）。分页按 (createdAt, id) 排序，不会跳过或重复事件。未知参数或无效 cursor 返回 400。",
        req: `limit       integer 1-200 (default 50)
cursor      string (next of the previous page)
action      prefix, e.g. "monitor" or "status_page.share_link"
actorId     user id or API key id
targetType  e.g. "monitor", "channel", "status_page", "api_key", "member"
targetId    id of the object
from, to    ISO 8601 date-time with offset`,
        res: `{ events: [{ id, projectId, actorType: "user" | "api_key" | "system", actorId, actorLabel, action, targetType, targetId, changes: { fields: string[], values?: {...} } | null, ip, createdAt }], next: string | null }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/audit-events/export?format=csv", en: "Download the matching events (same filters, no cursor or limit) as CSV (default) or JSON Lines (format=jsonl), newest first, streamed and capped at 100,000 rows. CSV cells that start with =, +, -, @, a tab, carriage return or line feed, or with leading whitespace followed by one of those characters, are prefixed with an apostrophe so spreadsheets do not run them as formulas. Each export is itself recorded in the log.", zh: "下载符合条件的事件（筛选参数相同，不含 cursor 和 limit），格式为 CSV（默认）或 JSON Lines（format=jsonl），按时间倒序流式输出，最多 100,000 行。以 =、+、-、@、制表符、回车或换行开头，或在前导空白后紧跟这些字符的 CSV 单元格会加上单引号前缀，防止电子表格将其作为公式执行。每次导出本身也会记入日志。",
        res: `CSV columns: created_at, id, action, actor_type, actor_id, actor_label, target_type, target_id, project_id, ip, changes` },
    ],
    noteEn: "Recorded after a change succeeds: monitors (create, update, delete, import), status pages (create, update, delete, access revoke, share links, custom domain set, verify and remove, subscriber removal, and domain.withdrawn by the system when the scheduled re-check withdraws a domain), channels, incidents (create, update, resolve, acknowledge), maintenance, projects, workspace settings, members (invite, cancel invitation, role change, remove, including removing oneself, and leave), workspace rename, API keys (create, revoke), webhook inboxes and events, and exports of the audit log itself (audit.export, with the format and the names of the filters used). Maintenance end, skip and cancel are recorded only when a window actually changed. Also recorded: on-call schedules, layers, overrides, escalation policies and calendar links (oncall_schedule.*, oncall_layer.*, oncall_override.*, escalation_policy.*, oncall_calendar.*), and each escalation step the system sends (incident.escalate, incident.escalation_notify with the person as target). changes lists the names of the fields a request set; a value is kept only for harmless settings such as a name, role, visibility or toggle. Passwords, tokens, API key values, channel settings (webhook URLs, bot tokens), monitor targets, headers and bodies are never stored. The log is append-only: the database refuses UPDATE and DELETE on it except for retention, which removes events older than 365 days by default (AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS when self-hosting).",
    noteZh: "在更改成功后记录：监控项（创建、更新、删除、导入）、状态页（创建、更新、删除、撤销访问、分享链接、自定义域名的设置、验证和移除、移除订阅者，以及定期复查撤销域名时由系统记录的 domain.withdrawn）、告警渠道、事件（创建、更新、解决、确认）、维护窗口、项目、工作区设置、成员（邀请、取消邀请、角色变更、移除，包括移除自己和主动退出）、工作区重命名、API 密钥（创建、撤销）、Webhook 收件箱和事件，以及审计日志本身的导出（audit.export，记录格式和所用筛选条件的名称）。维护窗口的结束、跳过和取消仅在确实改变了窗口时记录。另外还会记录：值班表、层级、替班、升级策略和日历链接（oncall_schedule.*、oncall_layer.*、oncall_override.*、escalation_policy.*、oncall_calendar.*），以及系统发出的每个升级步骤（incident.escalate，以及以被通知者为对象的 incident.escalation_notify）。changes 列出请求设置的字段名；只有名称、角色、可见性、开关等无害设置会保留取值。密码、令牌、API 密钥值、渠道配置（Webhook 地址、机器人令牌）、监控目标、请求头和请求体从不保存。日志只能追加：数据库拒绝对其执行 UPDATE 和 DELETE，唯一例外是保留期清理，默认删除 365 天前的事件（自托管时可用 AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS 调整）。",
  },
  {
    id: "sso", en: "Single sign-on (OIDC)", zh: "单点登录（OIDC）",
    eps: [
      { m: "GET", p: "/sso", en: "The active workspace's OpenID Connect connection and its email domains, with the TXT record that verifies each one. Workspace owner only, from a signed-in session: admins, members, API keys and agents get 403. The client secret is write-only and never returned.", zh: "当前工作区的 OpenID Connect 连接及其邮箱域名，并附带验证每个域名所需的 TXT 记录。仅限工作区所有者在已登录的会话中调用：管理员、普通成员、API 密钥和智能体均返回 403。客户端密钥只写不读，从不返回。",
        res: `{ callbackUrl, instanceProvider: boolean, connection: null | { id, issuer, clientId, hasClientSecret: true, defaultRole: "member" | "admin", requireSso, enabled, domains: [{ domain, verified, verifiedAt, txtName, txtValue }] } }` },
      { m: "PUT", p: "/sso", en: "Create (201) or update (200) the connection. The issuer's discovery document is fetched and checked first (exact issuer, code flow, PKCE S256, an asymmetric id_token algorithm); a provider on a private address or over http is refused (400, code blocked_target or invalid_issuer) unless the server sets SSO_ALLOW_PRIVATE_IDP=true. clientSecret is required on create and whenever the issuer or client ID changes (400, code secret_required); otherwise leave it out to keep the stored one. Entering a secret pins the token endpoint discovery names at that moment. Domains get a fresh TXT value; removing a domain removes its verification. Changing the issuer removes existing identity links. requireSso is turned off (with a warning) while no domain is verified; switching it on signs out members' sessions this connection did not create.", zh: "创建（201）或更新（200）连接。保存前会先获取并检查颁发者的发现文档（颁发者完全一致、支持授权码流程与 PKCE S256、使用非对称的 id_token 签名算法）；除非服务器设置了 SSO_ALLOW_PRIVATE_IDP=true，否则私有地址或 http 上的提供商会被拒绝（400，code 为 blocked_target 或 invalid_issuer）。创建时以及更换颁发者或客户端 ID 时必须提供 clientSecret（否则返回 400，code 为 secret_required）；其他更新省略即保留已存的密钥。填写密钥时会固定当时发现文档指明的令牌端点。新增域名会获得新的 TXT 值；移除域名会同时移除其验证状态。更换颁发者会删除已有的身份关联。在没有已验证域名时，requireSso 会被关闭并返回提示；开启它会退出成员中不是由此连接创建的会话。",
        req: `issuer        https URL, e.g. "https://idp.example.com/realms/acme" (exactly as the provider names itself)
clientId      string
clientSecret  string (write-only)
domains       string[] (up to 20 email domains)
defaultRole   "member" | "admin" (default "member"; for people provisioned on first sign-in)
requireSso    boolean (default false)
enabled       boolean (default true)` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/sso/test", en: "Fetch and check an issuer's discovery document without saving anything.", zh: "获取并检查颁发者的发现文档，不保存任何内容。", req: `issuer  string`, res: `{ ok: true, issuer, authorizationEndpoint, tokenEndpoint, jwksUri, algorithms }` },
      { m: "POST", p: "/sso/domains/:domain/verify", en: "Look up _montral-challenge.<domain> and mark the domain verified when its TXT record holds the value exactly. A domain is verified for one connection on the whole instance (409 when another workspace holds it). Verified domains are re-checked periodically; GET /sso shows checkError and failingSince, and a withdrawn domain releases its claim.", zh: "查询 _montral-challenge.<domain>，当其 TXT 记录与给定值完全一致时将该域名标记为已验证。一个域名在整个实例中只能被一个连接验证（被其他工作区占用时返回 409）。已验证的域名会定期复查；GET /sso 返回 checkError 和 failingSince，被撤销的域名会释放占用。", res: `{ verified: true }` },
      { m: "DELETE", p: "/sso", en: "Delete the connection, its domains and every identity link made through it.", zh: "删除连接、其域名以及通过它建立的所有身份关联。" },
      { m: "POST", p: "/auth/sso/start", en: "Start a sign-in (no session needed): by work email (its verified domain, else the instance-wide provider) or by workspace slug. With intent \"link\" the signed-in user links an identity whose verified email equals their own. Returns the identity provider's URL to open in the browser and sets a short-lived cookie that binds the attempt to this browser. 404 (code SSO_NOT_CONFIGURED) when nothing matches.", zh: "发起登录（无需会话）：按工作邮箱（其已验证的域名，否则使用全实例提供商）或按工作区 slug。intent 为 \"link\" 时，已登录用户关联一个已验证邮箱与其账号邮箱相同的身份。返回需在浏览器中打开的身份提供商 URL，并设置一个将本次尝试绑定到该浏览器的短期 Cookie。没有匹配项时返回 404（code 为 SSO_NOT_CONFIGURED）。",
        req: `email      string (optional)
workspace  string, a workspace slug (optional)
intent     "signin" | "link" (default "signin")
returnTo   a path inside the app (default "/app")`, res: `{ url }` },
      { m: "GET", p: "/auth/sso/callback", en: "The redirect URI to register at the identity provider: <BETTER_AUTH_URL origin>/api/auth/sso/callback. Browsers only; it redirects to the app, or to /login?sso_error=<code> when the sign-in is refused.", zh: "需要在身份提供商处注册的重定向 URI：<BETTER_AUTH_URL 的源>/api/auth/sso/callback。仅供浏览器使用；成功时跳转到应用，被拒绝时跳转到 /login?sso_error=<code>。" },
    ],
    noteEn: "Sign-in uses the authorization code flow with PKCE (S256), a single-use state bound to the browser and a nonce; id_tokens must be signed with an asymmetric algorithm by a key from the provider's JWKS, and iss, aud, azp, exp, nbf and iat are checked. Only an email the provider marks email_verified: true in a verified domain of the connection is used. An existing Montral account is never linked because its email matches: its owner signs in first and links from Account settings (sso_error=link_required otherwise); a link never adds a workspace membership, and leaving or being removed deletes the link. With requireSso, members' sessions and API keys work on the workspace only if this connection's SSO session made them, and agent tokens only while the SSO session that authorized them (the token's sid) is still signed in (403 otherwise, also on the Better Auth organization, authorize, consent and API key endpoints); owners are exempt. Removed members are not provisioned again, even with a new account, until their address is invited (sso_error=access_removed). Audit actions: sso.domain_withdrawn (system, by the re-check), sso.connection_create, sso.connection_update, sso.connection_delete, sso.domain_verify, sso.sign_in (changes.values.type: provisioned, existing or linked) and sso.sign_in_refused (changes.values.reason).",
    noteZh: "登录使用带 PKCE（S256）的授权码流程、绑定到浏览器的一次性 state 以及 nonce；id_token 必须由提供商 JWKS 中的密钥以非对称算法签名，并会检查 iss、aud、azp、exp、nbf 和 iat。只使用提供商标记为 email_verified: true、且属于该连接已验证域名的邮箱。不会因为邮箱相同就关联已有的 Montral 账号：账号所有者需先登录，再在账户设置中关联（否则返回 sso_error=link_required）；关联不会带来工作区成员身份，退出或被移出工作区会删除关联。开启 requireSso 后，成员的会话和 API 密钥只有由该连接的 SSO 会话创建时才能用于该工作区，智能体令牌只在授权它的 SSO 会话（令牌中的 sid）仍处于登录状态时有效（否则返回 403，Better Auth 的组织、授权、授权同意和 API 密钥接口同样如此）；所有者不受影响。被移出的成员在其邮箱被重新邀请之前，即使新建账号也不会再次自动开通（sso_error=access_removed）。审计操作：sso.domain_withdrawn（由复查以系统身份记录）、sso.connection_create、sso.connection_update、sso.connection_delete、sso.domain_verify、sso.sign_in（changes.values.type：provisioned、existing 或 linked）以及 sso.sign_in_refused（changes.values.reason）。",
