<Doc titleZh="API 参考" descriptionZh="REST API 参考：认证、监控、故障、告警渠道、状态页和心跳。" description="REST API reference: authentication, monitors, incidents, alert channels, status pages and heartbeats." title="API Reference" updated="2026-11-10" toc>
  <div lang="en">
    <h1>API reference</h1>
    <p class="lede">Manage monitors, incidents, alert channels and status pages programmatically. The API is JSON over HTTPS.</p>
    <h2 id="start">Getting started</h2>
    <p>Base URL: <code>https://montral.invalid/api</code></p>
    <p>Create an API key in the app under <strong>API keys</strong>, then send it with every request, either as an <code>x-api-key</code> header or as <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;</code>. A key belongs to one workspace and can optionally be limited to specific projects.</p>
    <pre><code>curl https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "x-api-key: montral_..."</code></pre>
    <p>Connecting an AI agent? See the <a href="/docs/mcp">MCP guide</a>.</p>
    <h2 id="projects-scoping">Project scoping</h2>
    <p>Most resources live in a project. Choose the project with the <code>x-project-id</code> header (a project id from <code>GET /projects</code>). If it is missing, the key's first permitted project, or else the workspace's oldest project, is used. A key limited to some projects gets <code>403</code> for any project it may not use, including an unknown id. Send <code>x-project-id: all</code> to read across every permitted project: <code>GET /monitors</code>, <code>GET /incidents</code> and <code>GET /counts</code> then cover all of them, <code>GET /projects/overview</code> returns per-project totals, and writes to project resources return <code>400</code>. <code>GET /workspaces</code> lists the workspaces you belong to and <code>GET /usage</code> the current workspace's usage.</p>
    <h2 id="errors">Errors</h2>
    <p>Errors return a JSON body <code is:raw>{ "error": "message" }</code> with a matching status: <code>400</code> invalid request, <code>401</code> missing or invalid credentials, <code>403</code> not permitted, <code>404</code> not found or not in your project, <code>409</code> conflict, <code>429</code> too many requests, <code>5xx</code> server error. Request bodies that fail validation return <code>400</code> with a JSON description of the invalid fields. Deletes return <code>204</code> with no body. Timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC; ids are UUIDs.</p>
    <p>HTTP request bodies accept raw UTF-8 text (up to 16 KiB), including JSON or form data. Set Content-Type in headers; Content-Length is calculated by the runtime. The form displays UTF-8 byte usage and blocks oversized bodies. Checks repeat on schedule: use a safe test endpoint. Bodies are masked for members; changing the target, method, headers or body while retaining stored secrets requires an owner or admin. A masked export cannot restore a body: provide the original. On a redirect to another origin the custom headers (API keys, tokens, cookies) are not forwarded, a 307 or 308 that would resend the body there is refused, and a 301, 302 or 303 turns the request into a GET without the body; an http to https upgrade on the same host keeps the body. Upgrade remote probes to advertise <code>http-request-body-v1</code>; a probe's capability is checked before such a request and remembered for 30 seconds, so a rolled-back probe can still receive bodies for up to that long. Older probes are unavailable for these checks, and the scheduler falls back locally if none can answer.</p>
    <p>HTTP 请求体支持最多 16 KiB 的 UTF-8 文本（如 JSON 或表单数据），请在请求头设置 Content-Type；Content-Length 由运行时计算。表单按 UTF-8 字节显示大小并阻止提交超限请求体。检测会周期性执行，请使用安全的测试接口。成员只能看到请求体掩码；保留已有密钥时，只有所有者和管理员可以修改目标、方法、请求头或请求体。掩码导出无法恢复请求体，需要补充原始内容。重定向到其他源时，自定义请求头（API 密钥、令牌、Cookie）不会被转发；会重新发送请求体的 307 或 308 跨源重定向会被拒绝，301、302、303 会改为不带请求体的 GET；同一主机从 http 升级到 https 时保留请求体。远程探针需升级并声明 <code>http-request-body-v1</code> 能力，发送此类请求前会确认探针能力并缓存 30 秒，因此探针回滚后最多 30 秒内仍可能收到请求体。旧探针对这些检测不可用；所有探针不可用时，调度器回退到本地检测。</p>
    <h3>Import preview / 导入预览</h3>
    <p>POST <code>/monitors/import/preview</code> with an array or <code>{'{ source: "backup:production", monitors: [...] }'}</code>. Review the report, then send the same data to <code>/monitors/import</code>, including the preview's <code>destination</code> to reject workspace/project changes. Preview never creates monitors or sends alerts; it can resolve target DNS. Capacity and targets are revalidated when executing. Imports inherit the destination's auto-enabled channels.</p>
    <p>先向 <code>/monitors/import/preview</code> 提交数组，或包含 <code>source</code> 和 <code>monitors</code> 的对象。检查报告后，将同一数据发送到 <code>/monitors/import</code>，并附上预览返回的 <code>destination</code>，防止工作区或项目切换后误导入。预览不创建监控项或发送告警，但会进行目标 DNS 验证。执行时重新验证容量和目标，导入项继承目标项目自动启用的通知渠道。</p>
    <p>Each record can specify <code>source</code> and <code>sourceId</code> (or <code>id</code>). Identity is scoped to workspace, project and source. Repeated or concurrent imports skip existing identities; they never update or delete monitors. Without an ID, type/name/target determine a stable hash: changing those fields creates another monitor. Reuse a namespace for retries and choose a different namespace for a different source account. Native exports preserve provenance. Deleting an imported monitor permits importing it again. Preview is advisory and reserves no capacity. Invalid rows are skipped; exceeding plan capacity blocks the entire batch with 402.</p>
    <p>每条记录可指定 <code>source</code> 和 <code>sourceId</code>（或 <code>id</code>）。标识在工作区、项目和来源范围内唯一。重复或并发导入会跳过已有标识，不会更新或删除监控项。无 ID 时按类型、名称和目标生成稳定哈希；修改这些字段会创建新项。重试复用来源标识，不同来源账号使用不同标识。本系统导出会保留来源信息。删除已导入项后可重新导入。预览不会预留容量；无效记录会跳过，超出套餐容量则整批拒绝并返回 402。</p>
    <p>Reports include unsupported fields, removed channel/dependency references and interval/region adjustments. Masked headers and unsupported authentication/body fields (any field named like a credential, for example basic_auth_user or oauth_token) are rejected instead of creating an unauthenticated check. Supported credential headers are retained but never echoed in preview. MCP exposes <code>preview_monitor_import</code> and <code>import_monitors</code>; read-only OAuth grants can preview, while execution needs write scope.</p>
    <p>报告包含不支持的字段、被移除的渠道或依赖引用，以及间隔和区域调整。掩码请求头和不支持的认证或请求体字段会被拒绝（名称像凭据的字段，例如 basic_auth_user、oauth_token，也同样拒绝），避免创建丢失认证的检测。支持的凭据请求头会保留，但不会在预览中回显。MCP 提供 <code>preview_monitor_import</code> 和 <code>import_monitors</code>；只读 OAuth 授权可预览，执行需要写入权限。</p>
    <h3>Domain registration expiry / 域名注册到期</h3>
    <p>Create a <code>domain</code> monitor with the explicit registered domain (for example <code>example.co.uk</code>), <code>domainExpiryWarnDays</code> from 1 to 365 (default 30), and preferably <code>intervalSec: 86400</code>. Intervals are bounded to 3600–86400 seconds. No parent domain is inferred. IANA RDAP discovery selects the registry; only exact domain responses with a usable top-level <code>expiration</code> event count as known. This is the registry date, not necessarily the registrar billing deadline or proof that a website is available.</p>
    <p>创建 <code>domain</code> 监控项并填写准确的注册域名（如 <code>example.co.uk</code>）。<code>domainExpiryWarnDays</code> 范围为 1 至 365 天，默认 30 天，建议设置 <code>intervalSec: 86400</code>；间隔限制在 3600 至 86400 秒。不自动推测父域名。检测通过 IANA 发现注册局 RDAP 服务，仅接受域名完全匹配且包含可用注册到期事件的响应。该日期不一定等于注册商账单截止日，也不代表网站是否可用。</p>
    <p>Known dates have a 26-hour freshness deadline, but lookups refresh when less than 24 hours remain: cache reuse is approximately two hours, and daily checks normally refetch. Unknown registry results are cached for fifteen minutes, IANA discovery for 24 hours. Concurrent fills of the same key are serialized. Manual checks use the same cache; expired data is never treated as healthy. Endpoints must be public HTTPS, redirects are refused, requests use the monitor timeout, and responses are capped at 1 MiB. Unsupported suffixes, missing dates and registry rate limits produce unknown results. Local DNS/egress failures confirmed as probe faults are inconclusive: they are not cached, counted as failures or used to open incidents. No WHOIS fallback is attempted. Registration warnings retain their own incidents and configured reminders; verified renewal clears them.</p>
    <p>已知日期的有效期为 26 小时，但剩余有效期不足 24 小时即提前刷新，因此通常只复用约两小时，每日检测一般会重新查询。注册局的未知结果缓存十五分钟，IANA 发现数据缓存 24 小时；同一键的并发填充会串行执行。手动检测使用相同缓存，过期数据不会作为正常依据。仅允许公网 HTTPS、不跟随重定向，请求使用监控项超时，响应限制为 1 MiB。不支持的后缀、缺少日期和注册局限流会产生未知结果。经确认属于探测端的本地 DNS 或出站网络故障没有结论，不写缓存、不计失败，也不会据此创建事件。不尝试 WHOIS 回退。注册日期预警保留专用事件和配置的提醒，续期后的日期经验证正常后恢复。</p>
    <p>Public pages report unavailable or stale registration data as unknown, and expiry warnings as degraded rather than a service outage. Registration checks do not contribute uptime percentages or suppress alerts for dependent services.</p>
    <p>公开状态页将缺失或过期的注册信息显示为未知，将到期预警显示为降级而非服务中断。注册日期检测不参与服务可用率计算，也不抑制依赖服务的告警。</p>
    <p>Protocol references: <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9224.html">RFC 9224 discovery</a>, <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9083.html">RFC 9083 domain events</a>, <a href="https://data.iana.org/rdap/dns.json">IANA bootstrap</a>.</p>
    <h3>TLS certificate / TLS 证书</h3>
    <p>Create a <code>certificate</code> monitor with a host or <code>host:port</code> (default port 443; for example <code>example.com</code> or <code>mail.example.com:993</code>) and <code>domainExpiryWarnDays</code> from 1 to 365 (default 30); the same field sets the warning window for domain and certificate monitors. Intervals are bounded to 3600–86400 seconds. Each check connects to the validated addresses of the host (private targets are refused unless <code>ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS</code> is set, as for TCP), sends the hostname as SNI, verifies the chain against the runtime's trusted roots and the hostname against the certificate, and reads its expiry date. A certificate with more than the warning window left passes; one inside it fails with the days left, the date and the issuer. Expired, not yet valid, self-signed or otherwise untrusted chains, hostname mismatches and failed handshakes fail with a fixed message naming the problem. Failures mark the monitor degraded until <code>failureThreshold</code> is reached; incidents are titled “certificate expires soon” or “certificate invalid”. Certificate checks do not suppress alerts for dependent monitors and run from <code>auto</code> only. They need the self-hosted Node runtime: a deployment on Cloudflare Workers refuses to create them with <code>400</code>, and checks of existing ones there are inconclusive (not recorded). STARTTLS protocols are not supported; the port must speak TLS from the first byte.</p>
    <p>创建 <code>certificate</code> 监控项并填写主机或 <code>主机:端口</code>（默认端口 443，例如 <code>example.com</code> 或 <code>mail.example.com:993</code>），<code>domainExpiryWarnDays</code> 范围为 1 至 365 天，默认 30 天；该字段同时用于域名与证书监控的预警窗口。间隔限制在 3600 至 86400 秒。每次检测连接经过验证的主机地址（与 TCP 相同，除非设置 <code>ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS</code>，否则拒绝内网目标），以主机名作为 SNI，按运行时信任的根证书验证证书链并校验主机名，再读取到期日。剩余有效期超过预警窗口即通过；在窗口内则失败，并给出剩余天数、日期和签发者。证书已过期、尚未生效、自签名或证书链不受信任、主机名不匹配以及握手失败时，以固定的错误信息说明原因。失败在达到 <code>failureThreshold</code> 之前将监控项标记为降级；事件标题为“certificate expires soon”或“certificate invalid”。证书检测不会抑制依赖监控项的告警，且只从 <code>auto</code> 位置运行。该检测需要自托管的 Node 运行时：部署在 Cloudflare Workers 上时创建请求会返回 <code>400</code>，已有监控项的检测结果没有结论，不会记录。不支持 STARTTLS 协议，端口必须从第一个字节开始使用 TLS。</p>
    <h3>Ping (ICMP) / Ping（ICMP）</h3>
    <p>Create a <code>ping</code> monitor with a hostname or IP address as <code>target</code>, without scheme, port or path (for example <code>example.com</code>, <code>192.0.2.10</code> or <code>2001:db8::1</code>). Each check resolves the name once, refuses private and internal addresses unless <code>ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS</code> is set (as for TCP), and sends one ICMP echo request to the validated address (IPv4 preferred) with the system <code>ping</code> binary, waiting up to <code>timeoutMs</code>. A reply passes with the round-trip time as latency, so <code>slowThresholdMs</code> applies as for other types. No reply fails with “No ping reply” or “Ping timed out”; when the server has no <code>ping</code> or may not send ICMP, the check is inconclusive with “Ping unavailable on this server” (no alert; the server logs it once). Ping checks run from <code>auto</code> only and need the self-hosted Node runtime: a deployment on Cloudflare Workers refuses to create them with <code>400</code>, and checks of existing ones there are inconclusive. The Docker image needs unprivileged ICMP (Docker's default); see <a href="/docs/self-host#ping">self-hosting</a>.</p>
    <p>创建 <code>ping</code> 监控项，<code>target</code> 填写主机名或 IP 地址，不带协议、端口或路径（例如 <code>example.com</code>、<code>192.0.2.10</code> 或 <code>2001:db8::1</code>）。每次检测只解析一次主机名，除非设置 <code>ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS</code>，否则拒绝私有和内网地址（与 TCP 相同），然后用系统 <code>ping</code> 程序向经过验证的地址（优先 IPv4）发送一个 ICMP 回显请求，最长等待 <code>timeoutMs</code>。收到回复即通过，往返时间记为延迟，<code>slowThresholdMs</code> 与其他类型一样生效。没有回复时以“No ping reply”或“Ping timed out”失败；服务器上没有 <code>ping</code> 或不允许发送 ICMP 时，检测结果为“不确定”（“Ping unavailable on this server”，不发送告警，服务器日志提示一次）。Ping 检测只从 <code>auto</code> 位置运行，需要自托管的 Node 运行时：部署在 Cloudflare Workers 上时创建请求会返回 <code>400</code>，已有监控项的检测结果没有结论。Docker 镜像需要允许非特权 ICMP（Docker 默认允许），见<a href="/docs/self-host#ping-zh">自托管文档</a>。</p>
    <p>Permissions follow workspace roles. Members can read everything and create or edit monitors, incidents and status pages; deleting a monitor or an alert channel, and editing a channel's configuration, need the owner or admin role. For members, channel credentials (webhook URLs, tokens, routing keys) and monitor request headers come back masked as <code>••••••••</code>; send the mask back unchanged to keep the stored value. Changing a monitor’s target, method or headers while retaining a stored header value requires an owner or admin; members can replace all headers with their own values or remove them. A few endpoints need a browser session and refuse API keys and agents with <code>403</code>: <code>GET /me/export</code> and <code>PATCH /me/locale</code>. Targets that resolve to private or internal addresses are refused with <code>400</code> and <code>"error": "target_not_allowed"</code> unless the operator set <code>ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS</code>.</p>
    <h2 id="limits">Rate limiting</h2>
    <p>Authenticated endpoints have no fixed per-key quota at the application level, but please be considerate and avoid tight polling; use the monitor's interval and alert channels instead. Sign-in, sign-up, password reset and two-factor attempts, the alert-channel test button and public subscription requests are rate limited and return <code>429</code> when exceeded.</p>
    <h2 id="native-signin">Native app sign-in (GitHub)</h2>
    <p>A native app signs in with GitHub inside <code>ASWebAuthenticationSession</code> and ends with a normal cookie session. The browser session owns the OAuth state, so the app must not start the flow with its own HTTP client. Check <code>GET /api/config</code> first: use this flow only when <code>auth.github</code> and <code>auth.nativeHandoff</code> are <code>true</code>.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <code>GET https://&lt;host&gt;/api/auth/native/github</code> in <code>ASWebAuthenticationSession</code> with callback scheme <code>montral</code>. It answers <code>302</code> to GitHub (<code>404</code> when GitHub is not configured, <code>429</code> when rate limited).</li>
      <li>The user signs in at GitHub. The server completes the sign-in and redirects the session to <code>montral://auth?token=&lt;token&gt;</code>. On failure it redirects to <code>montral://auth?error=&lt;code&gt;</code> with no token (for example <code>signup_disabled</code> when registration is closed).</li>
      <li>Exchange the token within 60 seconds:
<pre><code is:raw>POST https://&lt;host&gt;/api/auth/one-time-token/verify
content-type: application/json

{ "token": "&lt;token&gt;" }

200 { "session": { "token", "expiresAt", ... }, "user": { "id", "email", "name", ... } }
    + Set-Cookie: better-auth.session_token=...   (__Secure- prefix over HTTPS)
400 { "message": "Invalid token" }   unknown, already used or expired</code></pre></li>
      <li>Keep the cookie and use it like a browser session for every <code>/api</code> request.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>The token is random, valid for 60 seconds and works once. Only the exact callback <code>montral://auth</code> is accepted; no other scheme or path receives a token. The verify endpoint is rate limited (<code>429</code>). Account actions such as <code>GET /api/auth/list-accounts</code>, <code>POST /api/auth/link-social</code> and <code>POST /api/auth/unlink-account</code> need this cookie session and do not accept API keys. The last way to sign in cannot be unlinked (<code>400</code>).</p>
    <h2 id="push">Push notifications (mobile app)</h2>
    <p>The mobile app registers its APNs device token with the server it is connected to. These endpoints work with a session cookie or an API key and act on the signed-in person's own devices. Check <code>GET /api/config</code> first: <code>push.apns</code> is <code>true</code> when the server can send push notifications.</p>
<pre><code is:raw>PUT /api/push/devices
{ "token": "&lt;hex, 32-200 chars&gt;", "platform": "ios", "environment": "sandbox" | "production",
  "locale": "en" | "zh-CN", "name": "Ada's iPhone", "critical": false }          (locale, name and critical optional, name up to 80 characters)

200 { "id", "token", "platform", "environment", "locale", "name", "critical" }

GET    /api/push/devices           200 [ { "id", "token", "platform", "environment", "locale", "name", "critical" } ]
DELETE /api/push/devices/:token    204</code></pre>
    <p>Registering is an upsert by token: a token that was registered by another person moves to the caller. When push is configured, registering also gives every workspace where the caller is owner or admin a <em>Mobile app</em> channel (type <code>push</code>, on for new monitors) if it has none. A <code>push</code> channel alerts every member of its workspace who has a registered device; creating one while push is not configured fails with <code>400</code> and <code>code: "push_not_configured"</code>. A key limited to some projects registers devices but does not create channels.</p>
    <p><code>critical</code> (boolean, default <code>false</code>) opts the device in to critical alerts. Down alerts then go out with interruption level <code>critical</code> and a critical sound, which can break through Do Not Disturb; without it they are <code>time-sensitive</code>, and recoveries are always <code>active</code>. Leaving <code>critical</code> out when registering again keeps the stored choice. Alerts for one incident share an APNs collapse id, so reminders replace the earlier banner, and notifications are grouped per monitor. A token APNs reports as invalid is removed automatically, and a device that has not registered for 180 days is dropped.</p>
    <h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
    <h3>Create a monitor</h3>
    <pre><code is:raw>curl -X POST https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "x-api-key: montral_..." \
  -H "x-project-id: &lt;project id&gt;" \
  -H "content-type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Homepage","type":"http","target":"https://example.com","intervalSec":60}'</code></pre>
    <h3 id="json-assertion">Check a value in a JSON response</h3>
    <p>For a health endpoint that answers <code is:raw>{"status":"ok","data":{"items":[{"state":"ready","count":3}]}}</code>, require one value with <code>jsonPath</code>. The check fails when the body is not valid JSON, when the path is not there, or when the value does not match; status, keyword and JSON assertions must all pass. Bodies over 1 MB fail a JSON assertion, and error messages show at most 80 characters of a value.</p>
    <pre><code is:raw>curl -X POST https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "x-api-key: montral_..." \
  -H "content-type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"API health","type":"http","target":"https://api.example.com/health",
       "jsonPath":"data.items[0].state","jsonMatch":"equals","jsonExpected":"ready"}'</code></pre>
    <p><code>"jsonExpected":"3"</code> matches the number <code>3</code> at <code>data.items[0].count</code>; <code>"jsonMatch":"exists"</code> only requires the path to be present. Clear the assertion with <code is:raw>PATCH {"jsonPath":null}</code>. Regional probes run it only once upgraded; an older probe counts as unreachable (<code>probe_unreachable</code> for a spot check) instead of passing the check without it.</p>
    <h3>List monitors</h3>
    <pre><code>curl https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer montral_..."</code></pre>
    <h3>Send a heartbeat ping</h3>
    <p>Create a monitor with <code>"type":"heartbeat"</code> and call its URL from your job. No API key is needed; the token is the secret. Use <code>GET</code> or <code>POST</code>.</p>
    <pre><code>curl https://montral.invalid/api/heartbeat/&lt;heartbeatToken&gt;</code></pre>
    <p>Returns <code is:raw>{"ok":true}</code>, or <code>404</code> for an unknown token. A ping resolves an open incident for that monitor.</p>
    <h2 id="terraform">Terraform provider</h2>
    <p>The repository ships a Terraform (and OpenTofu) provider in <code>terraform-provider-montral/</code>. It is <strong>not published to any registry</strong>: build it from source with Go and point Terraform at the binary with <code>dev_overrides</code>, as described in its <code>README.md</code>. It manages monitors (<code>montral_monitor</code>), alert channels (<code>montral_alert_channel</code>), status pages (<code>montral_status_page</code>), maintenance windows (<code>montral_maintenance_window</code>) project escalation (<code>montral_project_alerting</code>) and escalation policies (<code>montral_escalation_policy</code>), with <code>montral_monitor</code> and <code>montral_project</code> data sources. It talks to this REST API with an API key, verifies TLS, and refreshes every resource on each plan so changes made in the dashboard show up as drift.</p>
    <pre><code is:raw>provider "montral" {
  endpoint = "https://montral.example.com"   # or MONTRAL_ENDPOINT
  # api_key from MONTRAL_API_KEY; project_id optional (defaults to the key's first project)
}

resource "montral_monitor" "api" {
  name   = "API health"
  type   = "http"
  target = "https://api.example.com/health"
}</code></pre>
    <p>Use an owner's or admin's key: credentials in channel settings, monitor headers and request bodies are returned only to them, and with a member's key the provider keeps those values from state and cannot detect out-of-band changes to them. Status page passwords are never returned by the API.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh-CN">
    <h1>API 参考</h1>
    <p class="lede">通过程序管理监控项、事件、告警渠道和状态页。API 基于 HTTPS 与 JSON。</p>
    <h2 id="start-zh">快速开始</h2>
    <p>基础地址：<code>https://montral.invalid/api</code></p>
    <p>在应用的 <strong>API 密钥</strong> 页面创建密钥，并在每个请求中携带：使用 <code>x-api-key</code> 请求头，或 <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;</code>。密钥属于某个工作区，并可限定到特定项目。</p>
    <pre><code>curl https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "x-api-key: montral_..."</code></pre>
    <p>要接入 AI Agent？请看 <a href="/docs/mcp">MCP 文档</a>。</p>
    <h2 id="projects-scoping-zh">项目范围</h2>
    <p>大多数资源属于某个项目。通过 <code>x-project-id</code> 请求头指定项目（取自 <code>GET /projects</code> 的项目 id）。缺失或无效时，使用该密钥被授权的第一个项目，否则使用工作区最早创建的项目。受限密钥访问未授权的项目（包括不存在的 id）将返回 <code>403</code>。传入 <code>x-project-id: all</code> 可跨所有已授权项目读取：<code>GET /monitors</code>、<code>GET /incidents</code>、<code>GET /counts</code> 会汇总全部项目，<code>GET /projects/overview</code> 返回各项目的汇总，对项目资源的写入请求返回 <code>400</code>。<code>GET /workspaces</code> 列出你所属的工作区，<code>GET /usage</code> 返回当前工作区的用量。</p>
    <h2 id="errors-zh">错误</h2>
    <p>错误响应为 JSON <code is:raw>{ "error": "message" }</code>，并带有对应状态码：<code>400</code> 请求无效，<code>401</code> 缺少或无效的凭证，<code>403</code> 无权限，<code>404</code> 不存在或不在你的项目内，<code>409</code> 冲突，<code>429</code> 请求过多，<code>5xx</code> 服务器错误。请求体校验失败返回 <code>400</code> 及无效字段的 JSON 描述。删除成功返回 <code>204</code>，无响应体。时间为 ISO 8601 UTC，id 为 UUID。</p>
    <p>权限遵循工作区角色。成员可读取全部内容，并创建或编辑监控项、事件和状态页；删除监控项或告警渠道、修改渠道配置需要所有者或管理员角色。对成员而言，渠道凭证（Webhook 地址、令牌、路由密钥）和监控项的请求头会以 <code>••••••••</code> 掩码返回，原样回传掩码即保留已存储的值。保留已有请求头值时，修改目标、请求方法或请求头需要所有者或管理员权限；成员可以换成自己提供的全部请求头，或移除请求头。少数接口需要浏览器会话，API 密钥和智能体会得到 <code>403</code>：<code>GET /me/export</code> 与 <code>PATCH /me/locale</code>。解析到私有或内部地址的目标会被拒绝，返回 <code>400</code> 与 <code>"error": "target_not_allowed"</code>，除非运维设置了 <code>ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS</code>。</p>
    <h2 id="limits-zh">限流</h2>
    <p>需认证的接口在应用层没有固定的按密钥配额，但请合理使用，避免高频轮询；建议依靠监控项的检测间隔和告警渠道。登录、注册、重置密码与两步验证尝试、告警渠道的测试按钮以及公开的订阅接口都有限流，超出会返回 <code>429</code>。</p>
    <h2 id="native-signin-zh">原生应用登录（GitHub）</h2>
    <p>原生应用在 <code>ASWebAuthenticationSession</code> 中完成 GitHub 登录，最终得到普通的 Cookie 会话。OAuth 状态保存在发起流程的浏览器会话里，因此应用不能用自己的 HTTP 客户端发起流程。请先请求 <code>GET /api/config</code>：仅当 <code>auth.github</code> 与 <code>auth.nativeHandoff</code> 均为 <code>true</code> 时才使用此流程。</p>
    <ol>
      <li>在 <code>ASWebAuthenticationSession</code> 中打开 <code>GET https://&lt;host&gt;/api/auth/native/github</code>，回调 scheme 为 <code>montral</code>。它返回 <code>302</code> 跳转到 GitHub（未配置 GitHub 返回 <code>404</code>，被限流返回 <code>429</code>）。</li>
      <li>用户在 GitHub 登录。服务器完成登录后把会话重定向到 <code>montral://auth?token=&lt;token&gt;</code>。失败时重定向到 <code>montral://auth?error=&lt;code&gt;</code>，不带令牌（例如注册关闭时为 <code>signup_disabled</code>）。</li>
      <li>在 60 秒内兑换令牌：
<pre><code is:raw>POST https://&lt;host&gt;/api/auth/one-time-token/verify
content-type: application/json

{ "token": "&lt;token&gt;" }

200 { "session": { "token", "expiresAt", ... }, "user": { "id", "email", "name", ... } }
    + Set-Cookie: better-auth.session_token=...   （HTTPS 下带 __Secure- 前缀）
400 { "message": "Invalid token" }   令牌未知、已使用或已过期</code></pre></li>
      <li>保存该 Cookie，之后的所有 <code>/api</code> 请求都像浏览器会话一样携带它。</li>
    </ol>
    <p>令牌随机生成，有效期 60 秒，只能使用一次。只接受精确的回调地址 <code>montral://auth</code>，其他 scheme 或路径都不会得到令牌。兑换接口有限流（<code>429</code>）。<code>GET /api/auth/list-accounts</code>、<code>POST /api/auth/link-social</code>、<code>POST /api/auth/unlink-account</code> 等账号操作需要此 Cookie 会话，不接受 API 密钥。最后一种登录方式无法取消关联（<code>400</code>）。</p>
    <h2 id="push-zh">推送通知（手机 App）</h2>
    <p>手机 App 会把 APNs 设备令牌注册到它所连接的服务器。这些接口可用会话 Cookie 或 API 密钥调用，只操作当前登录者自己的设备。请先请求 <code>GET /api/config</code>：<code>push.apns</code> 为 <code>true</code> 表示服务器可以发送推送。</p>
<pre><code is:raw>PUT /api/push/devices
{ "token": "&lt;十六进制，32-200 个字符&gt;", "platform": "ios", "environment": "sandbox" | "production",
  "locale": "en" | "zh-CN", "name": "Ada 的 iPhone", "critical": false }          （locale、name 与 critical 可选，name 最多 80 个字符）

200 { "id", "token", "platform", "environment", "locale", "name", "critical" }

GET    /api/push/devices           200 [ { "id", "token", "platform", "environment", "locale", "name", "critical" } ]
DELETE /api/push/devices/:token    204</code></pre>
    <p>注册按令牌做 upsert：之前由其他人注册的令牌会转移给当前调用者。已配置推送时，注册还会为调用者担任所有者或管理员的每个工作区创建一个名为 <em>Mobile app</em> 的渠道（类型 <code>push</code>，对新监控默认开启），已有则不重复创建。<code>push</code> 渠道会通知其工作区中所有已注册设备的成员；未配置推送时创建会返回 <code>400</code> 与 <code>code: "push_not_configured"</code>。仅限部分项目的密钥可以注册设备，但不会创建渠道。</p>
    <p><code>critical</code>（布尔值，默认 <code>false</code>）表示该设备选择接收紧急提醒。开启后，宕机提醒会以 <code>critical</code> 中断级别和紧急提示音发送，可以突破勿扰模式；未开启时为 <code>time-sensitive</code>，恢复通知始终为 <code>active</code>。再次注册时省略 <code>critical</code> 会保留之前的设置。同一事件的提醒共用一个 APNs collapse id，因此提醒会替换设备上之前的横幅，通知按监控分组。APNs 判定无效的令牌会被自动移除，180 天未重新注册的设备也会被清理。</p>
    <h2 id="examples-zh">示例</h2>
    <h3>创建监控项</h3>
    <pre><code is:raw>curl -X POST https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "x-api-key: montral_..." \
  -H "x-project-id: &lt;project id&gt;" \
  -H "content-type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"Homepage","type":"http","target":"https://example.com","intervalSec":60}'</code></pre>
    <h3 id="json-assertion-zh">校验 JSON 响应中的值</h3>
    <p>对于返回 <code is:raw>{"status":"ok","data":{"items":[{"state":"ready","count":3}]}}</code> 的健康检查接口，可以用 <code>jsonPath</code> 要求其中一个值。响应不是合法 JSON、路径不存在或值不匹配时检测失败；状态码、关键字与 JSON 断言须全部通过。超过 1 MB 的响应无法通过 JSON 断言，错误信息中的值最多显示 80 个字符。</p>
    <pre><code is:raw>curl -X POST https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "x-api-key: montral_..." \
  -H "content-type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name":"API health","type":"http","target":"https://api.example.com/health",
       "jsonPath":"data.items[0].state","jsonMatch":"equals","jsonExpected":"ready"}'</code></pre>
    <p><code>"jsonExpected":"3"</code> 可匹配 <code>data.items[0].count</code> 处的数字 <code>3</code>；<code>"jsonMatch":"exists"</code> 只要求路径存在。用 <code is:raw>PATCH {"jsonPath":null}</code> 清除断言。区域探针升级后才会执行该断言；旧版探针会被视为不可达（单次区域检测返回 <code>probe_unreachable</code>），而不会在忽略断言的情况下判定通过。</p>
    <h3>列出监控项</h3>
    <pre><code>curl https://montral.invalid/api/monitors \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer montral_..."</code></pre>
    <h3>发送心跳</h3>
    <p>创建 <code>"type":"heartbeat"</code> 的监控项，并在你的任务中请求其地址。无需 API 密钥，令牌本身即是凭证。可使用 <code>GET</code> 或 <code>POST</code>。</p>
    <pre><code>curl https://montral.invalid/api/heartbeat/&lt;heartbeatToken&gt;</code></pre>
    <p>成功返回 <code is:raw>{"ok":true}</code>，令牌无效返回 <code>404</code>。收到心跳会关闭该监控项未结束的事件。</p>
    <h2 id="terraform-zh">Terraform Provider</h2>
    <p>仓库在 <code>terraform-provider-montral/</code> 中提供 Terraform（及 OpenTofu）Provider。它<strong>尚未发布到任何 Registry</strong>：请用 Go 从源码构建，并按其 <code>README.md</code> 的说明通过 <code>dev_overrides</code> 让 Terraform 使用该二进制文件。它可管理监控项（<code>montral_monitor</code>）、告警渠道（<code>montral_alert_channel</code>）、状态页（<code>montral_status_page</code>）、维护窗口（<code>montral_maintenance_window</code>）项目升级策略（<code>montral_project_alerting</code>）和升级策略（<code>montral_escalation_policy</code>），并提供 <code>montral_monitor</code> 与 <code>montral_project</code> 数据源。它使用 API 密钥调用本 REST API，校验 TLS 证书，并在每次 plan 时刷新所有资源，因此在控制台中所做的修改会显示为漂移。</p>
    <pre><code is:raw>provider "montral" {
  endpoint = "https://montral.example.com"   # 或 MONTRAL_ENDPOINT
  # api_key 读取 MONTRAL_API_KEY；project_id 可选（默认使用密钥的第一个项目）
}

resource "montral_monitor" "api" {
  name   = "API health"
  type   = "http"
  target = "https://api.example.com/health"
}</code></pre>
    <p>请使用所有者或管理员的密钥：渠道设置中的凭据、监控项请求头和请求体只返回给他们；使用普通成员的密钥时，Provider 会沿用状态文件中的值，无法发现在 Terraform 之外对这些值的修改。API 从不返回状态页密码。</p>
  </div>

