  <section id="public">
    <h2><span lang="en">Public status endpoints</span><span lang="zh-CN">公开状态接口</span></h2>
    <p class="note">
      <span lang="en">These endpoints need no authentication and are what powers public status pages. Paths are under <code>/api/public/status</code>; <code>&lt;slug&gt;</code> is the status page address. Unknown slugs return 404.</span>
      <span lang="zh-CN">这些接口无需认证，用于驱动公开状态页。路径位于 <code>/api/public/status</code> 之下，<code>&lt;slug&gt;</code> 为状态页地址。slug 不存在时返回 404。</span>
    </p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">Current status, 90 buckets of uptime history per component (daily, or hourly while history is under four days) and open incidents.</span><span lang="zh-CN">当前状态、每个组件 90 个时间桶的可用率历史（按天，历史不足四天时按小时）以及未结束的事件。</span></p>
    <pre><code is:raw>{ page: { slug, title, theme, showLatency },
  overall: "operational" | "degraded" | "outage" | "unknown",
  bucket: "day" | "hour",
  components: [{ id, name, group, status, uptime90d, days: [{ day, uptime }] }],
  incidents: [{ id, number, title, status, severity, startedAt, resolvedAt,
                updates: [{ id, body, status, createdAt }] }] }</code></pre>
    <p><span lang="en">Only public updates are listed; internal updates never appear here, in the history, in the RSS feed or in subscriber emails. <code>rootCause</code> and <code>postmortem</code> are added to an incident only when it is resolved, they are set, and a person has published them (<code>publishPostmortem</code>); resolving alone never does.</span><span lang="zh-CN">这里只列出公开更新；内部更新不会出现在此处、事件历史、RSS 订阅源或订阅者邮件中。仅当事件已解决、已填写、并且有人已发布（<code>publishPostmortem</code>）时，才会附带 <code>rootCause</code> 和 <code>postmortem</code>；仅仅解决事件不会公开它们。</span></p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/incidents?before=&lt;ISO date&gt;</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">Incident history, newest first, 15 per page. Pass the returned <code>next</code> as <code>before</code> to continue; <code>next</code> is null on the last page.</span><span lang="zh-CN">事件历史，按时间倒序，每页 15 条。将返回的 <code>next</code> 作为 <code>before</code> 传入即可翻页；最后一页 <code>next</code> 为 null。</span></p>
    <pre><code is:raw>{ items: [{ id, number, title, status, severity, startedAt, resolvedAt, rootCause?, postmortem?, updates: [...] }], next }</code></pre>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/rss.xml</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">RSS 2.0 feed of the latest 50 incidents and maintenance windows together (<code>application/rss+xml</code>); titles start with <code>[Incident]</code> or <code>[Maintenance]</code>. <code>/rss</code> is the same feed.</span><span lang="zh-CN">最近 50 条事件和维护窗口合并的 RSS 2.0 订阅源（<code>application/rss+xml</code>），标题以 <code>[Incident]</code> 或 <code>[Maintenance]</code> 开头。<code>/rss</code> 是同一个订阅源。</span></p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/badge.svg</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">SVG badge in the colour of the worst component state, cached for 60 seconds. An unknown or unpublished page gets a grey “unknown” badge. <code>?lang=zh</code> for Chinese.</span><span lang="zh-CN">以最差组件状态着色的 SVG 徽章，缓存 60 秒。不存在或未发布的页面显示灰色“未知”徽章。加 <code>?lang=zh</code> 显示中文。</span></p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/maintenance</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">Upcoming and recent maintenance windows as JSON. Window names are public: they show on the page, in the feeds and in subscriber emails, so do not put anything private in one.</span><span lang="zh-CN">计划中和近期的维护窗口（JSON）。窗口名称是公开的：会显示在状态页、订阅源和订阅者邮件中，请勿在其中写入私密内容。</span></p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/maintenance.ics</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">Maintenance windows as an iCalendar feed (up to 100 events, cached for five minutes).</span><span lang="zh-CN">维护窗口的 iCalendar 订阅源（最多 100 个事件，缓存 5 分钟）。</span></p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/llms.txt</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">A short plain-text summary of the page for language models: overall state, components, active incidents, upcoming maintenance and the machine-readable links.</span><span lang="zh-CN">面向语言模型的简短纯文本摘要：整体状态、组件、进行中的事件、即将到来的维护，以及机器可读的链接。</span></p>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m post">POST</span><code>/api/public/status/&lt;slug&gt;/subscribe</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">Subscribe an email address to incident updates. A confirmation email is sent; the response is <code is:raw>{ "ok": true }</code> either way, so it does not reveal who is subscribed. Limited to 10 requests per hour per client IP, 3 per address per page per hour, 5 per address across all pages per hour and 200 per page per hour (429), and 5000 subscribers per page (409).</span><span lang="zh-CN">订阅事件通知邮件。系统会发送确认邮件；无论是否已订阅，响应都是 <code is:raw>{ "ok": true }</code>，不会泄露订阅情况。限流：每个客户端 IP 每小时 10 次、每个邮箱每个状态页每小时 3 次、每个邮箱跨所有状态页每小时 5 次、每个状态页每小时 200 次（429），每个状态页最多 5000 位订阅者（409）。</span></p>
    <p><span lang="en">Optional <code>monitorIds</code> (uuid array) limits the subscription to those components; empty or omitted means the whole page. Asking again with the same address replaces the locale and components of a pending address with the newest ones and sends the confirmation email again; a confirmed address gets no mail and no change. The per-address limit is shared by everyone, so someone else repeatedly submitting your address can delay your own confirmation mail until the hour is up.</span><span lang="zh-CN">可选的 <code>monitorIds</code>（uuid 数组）把订阅限定在这些组件；留空或不传表示整个页面。用同一邮箱再次请求时，待确认的邮箱会以最新的语言和组件覆盖原有选择，并再次收到确认邮件；已确认的邮箱不会收到邮件，也不会有任何改动。每个邮箱的限流对所有人共用，因此他人反复提交你的邮箱，可能让你自己的确认邮件延迟到下一个小时才能发出。</span></p>
    <pre><code is:raw>{ "email": "you@example.com", "monitorIds": [] }</code></pre>

    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/_/confirm?token=&lt;token&gt;</code></div>
    <div class="ep"><span class="m get">GET</span><code>/api/public/status/_/unsubscribe?token=&lt;token&gt;</code></div>
    <div class="ep"><span class="m post">POST</span><code>/api/public/status/_/unsubscribe?token=&lt;token&gt;</code></div>
    <p><span lang="en">Links used in subscription emails. Confirming redirects to the status page. Unsubscribing asks first: GET shows a small page with a button, and only the POST removes the address, so a mail scanner opening the link changes nothing. Subscriber emails also carry <code>List-Unsubscribe</code> and <code>List-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click</code> headers; a mail client's one-click button POSTs to this address and gets <code>200</code>.</span><span lang="zh-CN">订阅邮件中使用的链接。确认链接会重定向到状态页。退订需要二次确认：GET 只显示一个带按钮的小页面，只有 POST 才会移除该邮箱，因此邮件扫描程序打开链接不会产生任何影响。订阅者邮件还带有 <code>List-Unsubscribe</code> 和 <code>List-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click</code> 头；邮件客户端的一键退订按钮会向该地址发送 POST 并得到 <code>200</code>。</span></p>
  </section>
